th . ShapeNet55/34 Download the dataset from the PoinTr dataset instructions and keep the same directory structure. ShapeNet-Deform The deformed ShapeNet55 variant is generated online by pqdt/data/deformed_shapenet.py . ShapeNetCar-Occ Download the processed data from: (Google Drive) Use scripts in scripts/occlude to generate partial point clouds from meshes: python scripts/occlude/generate.py --dataset_dir /path/to/datasets --bbox_rescale_factor 1.1 --noise_std 0.003 --occ_num_lower_bound 10 --id_bias 0 python scripts/occlude/generate.py --dataset_dir /path/to/datasets --bbox_rescale_factor 1.2 --noise_std 0.004 --occ_num_lower_bound 20 --id_bias 32 python scripts/occlude/generate.py --dataset_dir /path/to/datasets --bbox_rescale_factor 1.3 --noise_std 0.005 --occ_num_lower_bound 30 --id_bias 64 python scripts/occlude/raycast_surface.py --dataset_dir /path/to/datasets Configs Restoration configs live under configs/restoration/ : configs/restoration/shapenet55.yml configs/restoration/shapenet_deform.yml configs/restoration/shapenet_occ.yml Each config uses explicit sections for dataset , dataloader , trainer , optimizer , scheduler , logger , and checkpoint . Training Edit the YAML files to set dataset, checkpoint, and logging paths, then run: python train.py --config configs/restoration/shapenet55.yml View experiments: tensorboard --logdir ./lightning_logs Test python test.py \ --config configs/restoration/shapenet55.yml \ --ckpt ./lightning_logs/ckpts/last.ckpt If --ckpt is omitted, checkpoint.test_path from the config is used. Citation If you find this repository useful, please cite our paper (to be updated): @inproceedings { wu2026pqdt , title = { PQDT: Pseudo-Query Dual Transformer for Robust Point Cloud Restoration } , author = { Wu, Haoqing and Nawotki, Alexa and Garcke, Jochen } , booktitle = { Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition } , pages = { 24195--24205 } , year = { 2026 } } About Repository for PQDT: Pseudo-Q